    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>DOMiNi</i> is a roguelike puzzle game that combines strategic placement of dominoes with a minimalist dungeon crawler experience. Connect dominoes to build paths, collect loot, and avoid deadly monsters as you progress through an increasingly challenging dungeon.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>7 unlockable classes</strong> with different sets of rules and dominoes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>21 procedurally generated levels</strong>, each one more difficult than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ tiles to discover,</strong> all with their own unique effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ shop items</strong> to improve your runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic gameplay, where every move counts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Permadeath</p></li></ul>",
